{
  "slug": "personal-data-protection-skill",
  "name": "Personal Data Protection Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build and maintain personal-data-protection-compliant applications for Southeast Asia. Tech-agnostic guidance covering Singapore PDPA 2012, Thailand PDPA B.E. 2562 (2019), and Indonesia UU PDP 27/2022 - organized by where in the stack each obligation lands, not by statute section number. Reference material, not legal advice.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `personal-data-protection` (Personal-data-protection compliance reference for engineers building applications subject to Singapore PDPA, Indonesia UU PDP 27/2022, Thailand PDPA B.E).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install personal-data-protection-skill@claude-community` from `AltByteSG/personal-data-protection-skill`.",
